(3) In determining whether a person designated as a comprehensive financial investment business entity under Article 77-2(1) at the time of the enforcement of this Decree falls under the grounds for revocation of designation pursuant to Article 77-2(4) of that Act, the previous provisions shall apply for up to 5 years from the date of the enforcement date of this Decree, notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 77-3(1) and (2).

